--[[
	*
	 * One spat-ball victim (see step.ts): loses TIGER_BALL_STAMINA_RATIO of maxStamina, is knocked along the ball's direction,
	 * and is stunned for TIGER_STUN_TICKS. Going to zero stamina knocks him down instead.
	 
